      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a paper for my international relations class about the efficacy of economic sanctions. i'm kind of stuck on how to frame the central debate. basically, are sanctions actually an effective way to promote democracy and hold bad actors accountable, or are they just a way for powerful nations to bully smaller ones for their own interests? how should i approach this in my intro?",
