      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, that sounds pretty definitive. you said by looking at the historical record it's \"clear\" that they're just tools of the powerful. so you're saying there isn't really a legitimate argument for them being effective? like, aren't there cases where they actually worked to pressure a government to change?",
